<title>USA: Investcorp acquires William Carter Co.</title>
<headline>Investcorp acquires William Carter Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investcorp said Thursday it had acquired William Carter Co, a marketer and manufacturer of baby and children's apparel.</p>
<p>Investcorp, an international investment group, and William Carter Co's management will own all of the company's capital stock.</p>
<p>Other terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Carter, based in Morrow, Ga., manufactures apparel under the Carter's, Carter's Classic and Baby Dior brand names.</p>
